package wacs:hello-render;

/// Parity world for the WACS.WASI.GFX.Webgpu render path.
/// Imports the full wasi:webgpu surface and exports start();
/// the guest renders a triangle to an offscreen texture, copies
/// the result to a readback buffer, maps + verifies expected
/// pixel colors.
///
/// Headless by design: no surface / window / swap-chain. The
/// swap-chain path is exercised by --windowed integration runs;
/// this fixture verifies the render pipeline + render-pass
/// chain in a way that a CI runner without a display can assert.
world hello-render {
    include wasi:webgpu/imports@0.0.1;

    /// Returns nothing on success; traps on mismatch.
    export start: func();
}
